{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-1\",\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"B1只写熟悉的沉思气息重新出现、柔软感重新打开，没有说他实际想起了某种生活；把「熟悉的柔软处」具体化成「又想起那种生活」，将珠子的氛围比喻落实成了明确的心理回想。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"回扣S06-6已经写明的想象带来满足，以过去的满足解释此刻愿意停留、不急于自我责问，没有新增前史或具体场景。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"暂时松弛、欢喜和不舍都能对应短暂喘息、安静退去及其中的不舍，没有把回头看等比喻动作写成真实行动。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-2\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S06-6已经说明想象那种生活曾带来满足，足以解释他此刻为什么愿意再次停留。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-3\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S07-4说明他仍有许多未解决的顾虑、无法定下来，这构成了眼前安静不能长久持续的现实牵制。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"不看珠子也能读出完整的心理过程：困境中柔软感回返，过去的满足使他愿意停留并暂缓自责，尚未解决的顾虑又使这份松弛只能暂时存在。\",\n  \"lost\": [],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c3867364-8c94-4e0c-847f-492a9fae0c92", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T011756872360Z", "elapsed_seconds": 109.969, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T01:19:46.837571+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e099b0a875905e0b8f1eb62cf671c26344254f1cf6d5080826a55400f7f58626", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b